      "id": "slash-for-or",
      "clause": "GOV.UK A to Z: or; 1: 5.3.2 d)",
      "severity": "advise",
      "say": "A slash stands in for \"or\" or \"and\", and the reader has to guess which. Write the word.",
      "patterns": [
